```console
$ scherzo-cloud run --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud runs

Usage: scherzo-cloud run [COMMAND]

Commands:
  cancel     Request cancellation of a Scherzo Cloud run
  create     Create a run
  input      Manage retained run inputs
  input-set  Manage Run Input Sets
  list       List Scherzo Cloud runs
  show       Show a run
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
